team/apps/5968/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Strategy"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Cloud","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":null,"dev":["Egosoft"],"pub":["Egosoft"],"released":"Jul 21, 2006","meta":72,"langs":["English","French","German","Italian","Spanish - Spain","Czech","Polish","Russian"],"min":[["OS","Windows 10 / 8 / 7 / Vista / XP / 2000 / ME / 98SE"],["Processor","Pentium III 800MHz or same grade"],["Memory","256MB RAM"],["Graphics","32MB 3D card compatible with Direct X 8.1"],["DirectX\u00ae","8.1"],["Hard Drive","1200MB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":1,"blurb":"You play Julian Gardna, continuing the story begun in X: Beyond the Frontier, in a space simulator where you fly between sectors, mine asteroids for materials and sell them on. The universe holds more than 130 sectors, some filled with nebulas that interfere with ships and stations.\n\nMore than 60 ships range from small scouts to large carrier-class vessels, and upgrades can be installed, including ones that use a scripting engine built for the game. Redesigned ships and stations and a refreshed graphics engine update the look of the series. This 2006 release is single-player and suits players who like open-ended trading and exploration."}}